": "104"}, {"n": 14, "text": "Evaluate: 32 ÷ 8 × 5 - 2 × 3", "options": [{"text": "17", "added": false}, {"text": "16", "added": false}, {"text": "14", "added": false}, {"text": "13", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": "14"}, {"n": 15, "text": "The ages of A and B are in the ratio 4 : 9. If the difference of their ages is 10 years, compare their ages after 4 years from now.", "options": [{"text": "12 : 19", "added": false}, {"text": "25 : 29", "added": false}, {"text": "6 : 11", "added": false}, {"text": "13 : 23", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Ages", "sub": "ratio-of-ages", "key_answer": "6 : 11"}, {"n": 16, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "12", "added": false}, {"text": "6", "added": false}, {"text": "15", "added": false}, {"text": "16", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "early-late", "key_answer": "15"}, {"n": 17, "text": "If 2% of x = 336, then x is equal to:", "options": [{"text": "16900", "added": false}, {"text": "33600", "added": false}, {"text": "16800", "added": false}, {"text": "33700", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": "16800"}, {"n": 18, "text": "The price of fuel decreases by 25%, 10% and 30% in three successive months, but increases by 60% in the fourth month. What is the percentage increase/decrease in the price of fuel in the fourth month as compared to its original price?", "options": [{"text": "Decreases by 30.76%", "added": false}, {"text": "Increases by 23.98%", "added": false}, {"text": "Decreases by 24.4%", "added": false}, {"text": "Increases by 27.32%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "successive-change", "key_answer": "Decreases by 24.4%"}, {"n": 19, "text": "The product of two numbers 